{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國能源部將氦列入關鍵材料清單，理由是這種元素對美國國內製造業和半導體生產至關重要，而且越來越容易受到供應鏈中斷的影響。美國能源部周五在聲明中表示，在許多關鍵應用中，這種惰性氣體沒有可行的替代品。已經列入清單的其他元素包括鈷、鎂和鋰。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583616.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T18:44:27.693573+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T18:20:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T18:38:08.835730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T18:38:08.835730+00:00","content_hash":"3d4e54b8791990099816307e3ae75046bf7f6d39a06b27bf6c9897880f53ea11","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}